            "text_position": "place-self-center-start text-start",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "",
            "custom_liquid": "<p>It starts with your body’s natural design. You were made to regenerate—from cells to systems. LifePharm’s science-backed solutions support that design using bioactive growth factors, stem cell activation, and telomere support to help restore vitality from the inside out.\n<br><br>\nFrom skincare to supplements to cutting-edge wellness technology, our products are built to recharge what matters most: your cellular health. \n<br><br>\nEven if you eat well, your environment—pollution, stress, and toxins—is beyond your control. That’s why LifePharm exists: to give your body the regenerative support it needs to thrive in today’s world.</p>",
            "content": "<p></p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
