            "content": "",
            "custom_liquid": "<h2 class=\"h2\">LifePharm Empowers<span style= \"color: #FF8F00;\"> Regeneration.</span></h2>\n<p>True regeneration begins with stem cells—the body’s natural repair agents. But their ability to divide, specialize, and restore damaged tissue depends on the length and integrity of telomeres, the protective caps on the ends of chromosomes. \n</p>\n\n\n<p>LifePharm’s egg bioactive growth factors are designed to support both: activating stem cells for cellular repair, while helping maintain telomere length to sustain that renewal process over time. Together, they work to restore vitality at the deepest level—where aging and regeneration begin.</p>\n\n<p>Our Cellnergy line builds on this foundation with solutions that use precisely tuned frequencies to support the body’s regenerative systems. These frequencies are designed to resonate with healthy cellular vibrations, helping to stimulate stem cell activity and promote optimal cellular performance. It’s regeneration powered by both biological nutrients and energy-based innovation.</p>",
