    "media_with_text_DngLqY": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "image_9K7x9g": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about_page_-_Telomere.jpg",
            "media_width": 50,
            "media_position": "end",
            "text_position": "place-self-center-start text-start",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "",
            "custom_liquid": "<p>At LifePharm, we don’t just claim results—we clinically measure them. In one of our key studies, participants who took 4 Laminine® capsules daily for 90 days showed a significant increase in telomerase activity, a biomarker closely linked to healthy aging and long-term cellular function.</p>\n<p>Telomerase helps preserve the length of telomeres, the protective caps on DNA strands, which are essential to cellular renewal and longevity. These findings indicate that Laminine may support the body’s natural ability to regenerate from within. \n</p>\n<p>Additional laboratory research has also shown that Laminine supports normal cell growth in human skin cells, confirming both its efficacy and safety on a cellular level. </p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "background_gradient": "",
